00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:10,720
Why did friends choose peach branch as Tet gift for Van?

2
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:29,270
Answer: Friends choose peach flower branch sent to Hanoi as Tet gift for Van because North doesn't have peach flowers.

3
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:44,800
Friends hope, peach branch with yellow flowers will carry Southern sunshine, bring Van a warm joy.

